# Safety is INCLUDED, not copied - edit the safety track once and every course
# carrying it follows. The same is true of every topic track below: each is
# named for what it teaches, not for the deck it was converted from, so
# another course can carry any of them without this file changing. The order
# here is the order the course teaches them in; it is not a property of the
# tracks.
# A page two tracks share sits where the course first reaches it, so
# gcode-and-toolpaths and lathe-operations are met inside machining-fundamentals.
