+ material-removal-overview
+ precision-measurement-and-layout
+ cutting-fluids
+ sawing-and-bench-work
+ mill-setup-and-tooling
+ machining-fundamentals
+ drilling-and-threading
+ lathe-tapers-and-threads
+ grinding
+ cnc-fundamentals
+ inspection-and-fixturing
+ workpiece-materials-for-machining
+ nontraditional-machining
